WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.162 --> 00:00:03.369
♪♪

00:00:03.369 --> 00:00:04.370
Let's get to the news.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:06.338
President Biden on Saturday

00:00:06.338 --> 00:00:09.275
played his first round of golf
since becoming president,

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:12.945
though he has picked up his
driver a few times this year,

00:00:12.945 --> 00:00:16.449
but only to stop his dog Major
from attacking a staff member.

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:20.854
[ As Biden ]
Get behind me!
Everybody get behind me!

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:24.524
That dog's got some Scranton
in him.

00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:27.126
That's right, President Biden
played his first round of golf

00:00:27.126 --> 00:00:29.962
since becoming president,
which, weirdly,

00:00:29.962 --> 00:00:33.265
is weirdly what made it
finally hit home for Trump.

00:00:33.265 --> 00:00:34.600
[ As Trump ]
Oh, my God.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.103
He is president now.

00:00:37.103 --> 00:00:41.107
All U.S. adults are now eligible
for the coronavirus vaccine.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:44.076
Not so fast,
Senator Kyrsten Sinema!

00:00:44.076 --> 00:00:45.945
They're probably gonna card you,
if you keep dressing like

00:00:45.945 --> 00:00:49.249
a three-episode character
from "Square Pegs."

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:52.085
Baze with the "Square Pegs" ref!

00:00:52.085 --> 00:00:53.419
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:57.357
Long-time --
Yeah, keep him in darkness.

00:00:57.357 --> 00:01:00.693
The Pegs Heads like
to keep it anonymous.

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:06.866
[ Laughter ]

00:01:06.866 --> 00:01:09.201
President Biden over the weekend

00:01:09.201 --> 00:01:11.504
attended the confirmation
of his grandson,

00:01:11.504 --> 00:01:14.507
but then Mitch McConnell said
it's too close to an election

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.343
and put all confirmations
on hold.

00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:19.712
Former President Trump released
a statement yesterday

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.380
praising
President Biden's decision

00:01:21.380 --> 00:01:24.050
to withdraw U.S. forces
from Afghanistan and called it,

00:01:24.050 --> 00:01:27.220
"a wonderful and positive
thing to do,"

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:29.288
which makes a lot more sense,
when you find out

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:32.425
he's joined the Taliban.
Allegedly.

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.861
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy said recently

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:37.330
that, though Florida
Representative Matt Gaetz is

00:01:37.330 --> 00:01:39.899
under federal investigation
for sex trafficking,

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.001
Gaetz will not be removed
from committee

00:01:42.001 --> 00:01:44.169
and is "innocent until proven --

00:01:44.169 --> 00:01:45.838
Oh, really? On Venmo?

00:01:45.838 --> 00:01:47.173
Wow, just right out there?

00:01:47.173 --> 00:01:48.975
Still, I think
we should wait and --

00:01:48.975 --> 00:01:51.477
That's him, there?
Oh, boy.

00:01:51.477 --> 00:01:53.812
You guys are making this tough."

00:01:53.812 --> 00:01:55.181
Senator Bernie Sanders

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:57.983
and Representative
Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez today

00:01:57.983 --> 00:02:01.153
unveiled the Green New Deal
for Public Housing Act,

00:02:01.153 --> 00:02:03.322
which should keep Fox News busy

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:08.260
until "Danier" Tiger comes out
as gender nonbinary.

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.563
I think I mumbled it.
It's Daniel Tiger.

00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:13.166
-Not Danier.
-So, you know, save the --

00:02:13.166 --> 00:02:14.634
save the emails.

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.302
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:18.505
I knew what it was --
It's a flub.

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:20.406
A flub is different
than a mistake.

00:02:20.406 --> 00:02:24.010
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.411
Yesterday was

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:28.581
National Transfer Money
to Your Daughter's Account Day.

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.883
This according
to an increasingly suspicious

00:02:30.883 --> 00:02:35.087
calendar your daughter got you
for Christmas.

00:02:35.087 --> 00:02:38.591
"BTS Appreciation Day"?

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:41.260
A dozen of the top
European soccer clubs

00:02:41.260 --> 00:02:42.494
announced over the weekend

00:02:42.494 --> 00:02:44.497
that they will leave
the Champions League

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:46.666
and form a new breakaway league.

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:48.834
Fans said they were hurt
by the move,

00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:52.304
but, 10 seconds later,
they were fine.

00:02:52.304 --> 00:02:55.741
That's a very niche observation
about soccer,

00:02:55.741 --> 00:02:59.011
about soccer injuries,
from Ian.

00:02:59.011 --> 00:03:00.847
NASA today
successfully conducted

00:03:00.847 --> 00:03:03.349
its first controlled flight
on another planet

00:03:03.349 --> 00:03:06.252
and then immediately flew it
into their neighbor's yard.

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:09.689
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.689 --> 00:03:11.323
Federal regulators on Saturday

00:03:11.323 --> 00:03:13.158
issued an emergency
safety warning

00:03:13.158 --> 00:03:15.461
for Peloton's Tread+ treadmill.

00:03:15.461 --> 00:03:18.131
The warning reads,
"Do not get this for your wife,

00:03:18.131 --> 00:03:20.933
unless she explicitly
asks for it."

00:03:20.933 --> 00:03:22.568
Two intoxicated men in France

00:03:22.568 --> 00:03:25.838
recently injected hemorrhoid
cream into their genitals.

00:03:25.838 --> 00:03:28.407
But they're still not sure
about getting the COVID vaccine.

00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:30.910
[ French accent ]
I have read some things.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:33.579
There are some, eh,
troubling data.

00:03:33.579 --> 00:03:36.415
[ Laughter ]

00:03:36.415 --> 00:03:39.485
Is there any more
hemorrhoid cream?

00:03:39.485 --> 00:03:41.620
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.620 --> 00:03:43.355
And finally,
according to research,

00:03:43.355 --> 00:03:44.857
waking up to your favorite song

00:03:44.857 --> 00:03:47.359
can make you feel
more alert and less groggy.

00:03:47.359 --> 00:03:49.028
It will also, in a week,

00:03:49.028 --> 00:03:50.963
make you hate
your favorite song.

00:03:50.963 --> 00:03:52.331
♪♪

00:03:52.331 --> 00:03:54.700
President Biden tweeted
yesterday that everyone

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:58.504
16 and older can now receive the
coronavirus vaccine, and added,

00:03:58.504 --> 00:04:00.172
"Go and get 'em, folks."

00:04:00.172 --> 00:04:02.375
Said teens, "Sure thing.
Just one question.

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:05.878
Um, what does 'folks' mean?"

00:04:05.878 --> 00:04:08.114
President Biden released
a short video yesterday

00:04:08.114 --> 00:04:10.916
encouraging Americans
to get the coronavirus vaccine.

00:04:10.916 --> 00:04:12.818
It wasn't supposed to be short.

00:04:12.818 --> 00:04:14.687
He just accidentally hit send.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:16.322
-For months
I've been telling Ameri--

00:04:16.322 --> 00:04:19.359
-[ As Biden ]
Son of a gun.

00:04:19.359 --> 00:04:21.460
Jill!

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:23.162
According to reports,
White House officials

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.698
are currently working
on a large spending plan

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:28.201
centered on child care
and paid family leave.

00:04:28.201 --> 00:04:30.669
Not to be confused
with the last administration,

00:04:30.669 --> 00:04:32.905
which was just a paid family.

00:04:32.905 --> 00:04:35.574
Georgia Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene announced

00:04:35.574 --> 00:04:36.742
over the weekend that she plans

00:04:36.742 --> 00:04:39.178
to introduce legislation
that would expel

00:04:39.178 --> 00:04:41.881
Democratic Representative
Maxine Waters from Congress.

00:04:41.881 --> 00:04:45.218
When asked if the move was
in response to Waters' comments

00:04:45.218 --> 00:04:48.387
about protesters, Greene said,
"What comments?"

00:04:48.387 --> 00:04:49.722
In a new interview,

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:52.925
former Republican Representative
Denver Riggleman said

00:04:52.925 --> 00:04:54.927
that Representative
Marjorie Taylor Greene's

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:59.231
proposed America First caucus
is "racism in a jar."

00:04:59.231 --> 00:05:01.567
So, mayonnaise?

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:04.303
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
announced yesterday he's suing

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:07.806
voting machine manufacturer
Dominion for $1.6 billion.

00:05:07.806 --> 00:05:10.176
Though, he's just jealous
because their voting machines

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.811
are more comfortable to sleep on
than his pillows.

00:05:12.811 --> 00:05:14.613
According to polls,
Americans are more interested

00:05:14.613 --> 00:05:17.750
in trying edibles than any other
type of cannabis product.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:22.021
Wow. America's the only country
that starts with the munchies.

00:05:22.021 --> 00:05:25.424
Today was Lima Bean Respect Day.

00:05:25.424 --> 00:05:26.692
In that case --

00:05:26.692 --> 00:05:27.960
[ English accent ]
You taste like ass,

00:05:27.960 --> 00:05:29.028
good sir.

00:05:29.028 --> 00:05:31.430
[ Laughter ]

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:34.801
To celebrate 4/20, the
unofficial marijuana holiday,

00:05:34.801 --> 00:05:36.769
a New York City
cannabis activist hosted

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:38.637
a Joints for Jabs event today

00:05:38.637 --> 00:05:41.440
and gave anyone who had received
the coronavirus vaccine

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:45.144
free marijuana, which explains
why so many New Yorkers

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:47.646
just got their third dose
of Pfizer.

00:05:47.646 --> 00:05:49.281
♪♪

00:05:49.281 --> 00:05:51.550
House Speaker Nancy Pelosi
is facing criticism

00:05:51.550 --> 00:05:53.852
after she gave
a speech yesterday

00:05:53.852 --> 00:05:55.488
thanking George Floyd for,

00:05:55.488 --> 00:05:58.424
"sacrificing your life
for justice."

00:05:58.424 --> 00:06:01.860
Wow, who'd have thought we'd
prefer her moment of silence?

00:06:01.860 --> 00:06:03.929
That's right,
Nancy Pelosi gave a speech

00:06:03.929 --> 00:06:05.498
thanking George Floyd for,

00:06:05.498 --> 00:06:07.767
"sacrificing your life
for justice."

00:06:07.767 --> 00:06:10.236
You know, if you're
an 81-year-old white person

00:06:10.236 --> 00:06:11.670
giving a speech about race,

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.639
you can just follow
this simple rule --

00:06:13.639 --> 00:06:15.207
don't.

00:06:15.207 --> 00:06:17.543
After former Minneapolis
Police Officer Derek Chauvin

00:06:17.543 --> 00:06:18.878
was found guilty yesterday,

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:21.113
Fox News host Tucker Carlson

00:06:21.113 --> 00:06:23.548
claimed the jury was intimidated
into the guilty verdict

00:06:23.548 --> 00:06:26.618
by the protests and the
Black Lives Matter movement,

00:06:26.618 --> 00:06:30.490
which is frustrating for Carlson
because he put a lot of work

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.424
into intimidating that jury.

00:06:32.424 --> 00:06:34.393
Former New Jersey Governor
Chris Christie

00:06:34.393 --> 00:06:37.229
is reportedly considering a run
for president in 2024.

00:06:37.229 --> 00:06:39.265
He thinks he might do well
in the polls,

00:06:39.265 --> 00:06:42.735
as long as "none of the above"
doesn't run again.

00:06:42.735 --> 00:06:45.437
MyPillow CEO Mike Lindell
celebrated the launch

00:06:45.437 --> 00:06:48.874
of his new social media
platform, Frank, this week

00:06:48.874 --> 00:06:52.111
by holding a 48-hour
livestream marathon.

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:55.514
What? How is anybody supposed
to stay awake for 48 --

00:06:55.514 --> 00:06:58.350
Oh, right. MyPillow.

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:00.519
Officials
in Burlington, Vermont,

00:07:00.519 --> 00:07:03.455
recently banned the use
of gas-powered leaf blowers,

00:07:03.455 --> 00:07:05.057
due to noise complaints.

00:07:05.057 --> 00:07:06.259
Said one resident,

00:07:06.259 --> 00:07:08.394
"Finally,
for the first time in my life,

00:07:08.394 --> 00:07:11.897
I can speak
with my normal voice."

00:07:11.897 --> 00:07:14.500
Florida Governor Ron DeSantis
recently signed into law

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.569
what he calls
the "strongest anti-rioting,

00:07:17.569 --> 00:07:19.505
pro-law enforcement measure
in the country."

00:07:19.505 --> 00:07:22.241
So maybe now, your grandparents
will think twice

00:07:22.241 --> 00:07:25.044
before butting in line
for the early-bird special.

00:07:25.044 --> 00:07:28.280
According to a recent report,
the UK's fossil fuel industry

00:07:28.280 --> 00:07:30.615
may achieve
net-zero carbon emissions

00:07:30.615 --> 00:07:32.484
before it achieves
gender equality.

00:07:32.484 --> 00:07:37.223
Either way, 2090 is shaping up
to be a really exciting year.

00:07:37.223 --> 00:07:40.859
Netflix announced yesterday
that it will spend $17 billion

00:07:40.859 --> 00:07:42.794
on content for 2021.

00:07:42.794 --> 00:07:45.131
"Oh!
Oh, honey, no.

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:47.667
We're --
We're going outside now."

00:07:47.667 --> 00:07:49.835
And, finally,
Apple yesterday announced

00:07:49.835 --> 00:07:51.804
a new purple-colored iPhone.

00:07:51.804 --> 00:07:55.107
So, is that new enough for you?
Happy?

00:07:55.107 --> 00:07:57.643
Are you greedy vultures ready
to get an entirely new,

00:07:57.643 --> 00:07:59.211
but practically identical, phone

00:07:59.211 --> 00:08:00.479
a year after you bought
your last one?

00:08:00.479 --> 00:08:01.680
'Cause these guys can't

00:08:01.680 --> 00:08:03.348
keep reinventing
the mother-loving wheel.

00:08:03.348 --> 00:08:05.985
They added the third lens,
but you hated the third lens.

00:08:05.985 --> 00:08:07.787
Then, they gave you
a redheaded emoji,

00:08:07.787 --> 00:08:09.755
but then, you all suddenly
hated redheads.

00:08:09.755 --> 00:08:12.091
Fine. Then guess what.
You get a purple phone now.

00:08:12.091 --> 00:08:14.726
Boom. That's the new
groundbreaking phone.

00:08:14.726 --> 00:08:16.829
So just give them $1,000,

00:08:16.829 --> 00:08:18.664
come pick up your dumb
purple mean machines,

00:08:18.664 --> 00:08:21.600
and go back to your
pathetic little lives.

00:08:21.600 --> 00:08:23.636
That was the actual
press release.

00:08:23.636 --> 00:08:25.437
♪♪

00:08:25.437 --> 00:08:27.573
Today was Earth Day.

00:08:27.573 --> 00:08:30.108
"Ah, yes, the place
I'm totally from,"

00:08:30.108 --> 00:08:31.677
said Mark Zuckerberg.

00:08:31.677 --> 00:08:34.079
[ Laughter ]
That's right,
today was Earth Day,

00:08:34.079 --> 00:08:36.815
even though I didn't
plan it. [planet]

00:08:36.815 --> 00:08:39.685
[ Laughter ]
So I didn't want to do that joke

00:08:39.685 --> 00:08:41.319
and, when I read it today,

00:08:41.319 --> 00:08:43.689
because the jokes are submitted
with names on it,

00:08:43.689 --> 00:08:45.324
I saw that Ian wrote it.

00:08:45.324 --> 00:08:47.927
Then, I did some digging
and Baze told me

00:08:47.927 --> 00:08:50.662
that Mike Scollins wrote it

00:08:50.662 --> 00:08:52.498
and put Ian's name on it.

00:08:52.498 --> 00:08:54.266
[ Laughter ]

00:08:54.266 --> 00:08:57.436
That's the kind of monster
Mike Scollins is.

00:08:57.436 --> 00:08:59.271
That's his friend.

00:08:59.271 --> 00:09:02.107
He did that to his friend.

00:09:02.107 --> 00:09:04.276
Tanks for nothing.
[ Laughter ]

00:09:04.276 --> 00:09:05.844
President Biden today
announced a pledge

00:09:05.844 --> 00:09:10.215
to reduce U.S. greenhouse gas
emissions by 50%, by 2030.

00:09:10.215 --> 00:09:11.350
Added Biden, "Of course,

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:13.586
that responsibility
will ultimately fall

00:09:13.586 --> 00:09:15.187
to President The Rock."

00:09:15.187 --> 00:09:18.257
[ Laughter ]
Teenage climate activist
Greta Thunberg

00:09:18.257 --> 00:09:20.826
addressed a House Subcommittee
on Environment today

00:09:20.826 --> 00:09:22.928
to discuss
fossil fuel subsidies,

00:09:22.928 --> 00:09:24.930
though it wasn't
encouraging that,

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.898
every time she said fossil fuel,

00:09:26.898 --> 00:09:29.067
Republicans did the wave.

00:09:29.067 --> 00:09:31.370
New York Mayor Bill de Blasio
yesterday announced

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:34.940
a $30 million ad campaign to get
tourists back to the city.

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:37.609
Oh, that's weird. I thought
they were back already.

00:09:37.609 --> 00:09:40.713
When asked, in a new interview,
about the prospect

00:09:40.713 --> 00:09:43.415
of actor Matthew McConaughey
running for governor of Texas,

00:09:43.415 --> 00:09:45.818
