00:09:49.388 --> 00:09:52.792
Is it?
I mean, you won twice.

00:09:52.792 --> 00:09:54.126
[ Laughter ]

00:09:54.126 --> 00:09:56.762
Russian President Vladimir Putin
yesterday delivered

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:59.932
his annual state of the nation
address and, as always,

00:09:59.932 --> 00:10:01.266
the state of the nation was

00:10:01.266 --> 00:10:02.467
none of your business.

00:10:02.467 --> 00:10:04.503
