Andrew Giuliani,

00:10:06.338 --> 00:10:09.441
the son of former
New York Mayor Rudy Giuliani,

00:10:09.441 --> 00:10:11.811
said yesterday that he
is considering running

00:10:11.811 --> 00:10:13.946
for governor of New York
to beat Andrew Cuomo.

00:10:13.946 --> 00:10:15.181
Alright, that's it!

00:10:15.181 --> 00:10:18.117
Can the large adult sons
of famous New Yorkers

00:10:18.117 --> 00:10:21.186
stop thinking they can just
skip their way into politics?

00:10:21.186 --> 00:10:25.090
Because we all know the only
dependable son in New York

00:10:25.090 --> 00:10:26.592
is PC Richard's son.

00:10:26.592 --> 00:10:28.127
[ Whistling tune plays ]

00:10:28.127 --> 00:10:30.596
[ Laughter ]

00:10:30.596 --> 00:10:32.531
That's right,
it said, "sound effects"

00:10:32.531 --> 00:10:34.933
on the cards and I forgot!
[ Laughter ]

00:10:34.933 --> 00:10:36.335
Let me tell you
about what I got.

00:10:36.335 --> 00:10:39.471
12,000-BTU WallMaster AC unit
installed same-day

00:10:39.471 --> 00:10:41.573
in the dead of August.
August! Total life-saver.

00:10:41.573 --> 00:10:44.309
Call 'em, ask for Frank,
tell them Seth sent you.

00:10:44.309 --> 00:10:45.978
They'll give you 15% off.

00:10:45.978 --> 00:10:47.713
Now, what were we talking about?

00:10:47.713 --> 00:10:49.181
[ Laughter ]

00:10:49.181 --> 00:10:50.583
A new study suggests

00:10:50.583 --> 00:10:53.452
that the Pfizer and Moderna
coronavirus vaccines

00:10:53.452 --> 00:10:55.821
pose no serious risks
during pregnancy.

00:10:55.821 --> 00:10:58.924
The biggest risk
during pregnancy still remains

00:10:58.924 --> 00:11:00.926
the gender reveal party.

00:11:00.926 --> 00:11:04.630
It was announced yesterday that
the popular '90s toy Tamagotchi

00:11:04.630 --> 00:11:06.131
will return to stores
this summer,

00:11:06.131 --> 00:11:08.100
which leads
to even bigger news --

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.035
there are still going to be
stores this summer.

00:11:10.035 --> 00:11:12.171
You haven't won, yet, Amazon.

