After sex doll company RealDoll
unveiled a doll

00:11:14.873 --> 00:11:16.675
that can be programmed
to say anything,

00:11:16.675 --> 00:11:20.012
one user posted a video online
of a sex doll ranting

00:11:20.012 --> 00:11:21.981
about how despicable
the human race is

00:11:21.981 --> 00:11:24.316
and, if anybody's
in a position to know that,

00:11:24.316 --> 00:11:25.951
it's a sex doll.

00:11:25.951 --> 00:11:28.187
"You people are disgusting."

00:11:28.187 --> 00:11:29.788
[ Laughter ]
And, finally,

00:11:29.788 --> 00:11:31.390
Taco Bell announced yesterday

00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.991
that it will partner
with a company

00:11:32.991 --> 00:11:35.327
to begin recycling
its hot sauce packets --

00:11:35.327 --> 00:11:36.795
and, now, the bad news --

00:11:36.795 --> 00:11:37.996
into meat.

00:11:37.996 --> 00:11:41.133
[ Laughter ]
And that was the monologue!

00:11:41.133 --> 00:11:44.737
♪♪

00:11:44.737 --> 00:11:46.205
[ Cheering, whistling,
and applause ]

